           <property name="toolTip">
            <string>&lt;b&gt;Network Scanner Quick Help:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
        1. Click the &lt;b&gt;↻&lt;/b&gt; button to scan your local network subnet.&lt;br&gt;
        2. Known devices from your config will be matched and locked automatically.&lt;br&gt;
        3. For new devices, &lt;b&gt;double-click the empty 'Name' cell&lt;/b&gt;, type an alias, and click &lt;b&gt;'Save to Config'&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
        4. Select any row and click &lt;b&gt;'MacChange'&lt;/b&gt; to push its data to the main changer tab.</string>
           </property>
